    "Items and their parenthetical keys are copied verbatim from the official sample questionnaire page.",
    "The official parenthetical codes are (1)/(2)/(3)/(4)/(5) meaning factor number; mapping to dimension letters in this file is the transcriber's mapping (see official_scale_names below).",
