    "IMPORTANT: official factor 4 is 'Emotional Stability', NOT 'Neuroticism'. keying '+' is relative to Emotional Stability. This file maps dimension 4 -> 'N' for schema uniformity; a '+' keyed item on factor 4 is therefore LOW neuroticism."
